      "problem": "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the hyperboloid of two sheets ${x}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{4}=-1?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{4} & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{6} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{6}-{x}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of the hyperbola in $xy$-plane.",
